<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money mkt shortage 10.40 bln rand Sat.</title>
<headline>S.African money mkt shortage 10.40 bln rand Sat.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage dipped marginally to 10.403 billion rand on Saturday from Friday's 10.488 billion rand, the Reserve Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
